        "s1_title": "1. Data controller",
        "s1_text": "Nuvel (hereinafter, \"the company\"). Contact for privacy matters: hola@nuvelshape.store.",
        "s2_title": "2. Data we collect",
        "s2_text": "We collect the data you provide when placing an order (first and last name, delivery address, email address and phone number), as well as anonymous browsing data needed for the store to function (technical cookies).",
        "s3_title": "3. Purpose of processing",
        "s3_text": "The data is used exclusively to: (a) process and manage your order; (b) communications related to that order (confirmation, tracking, issues); (c) handle inquiries and return or exchange requests.",
        "s4_title": "4. Legal basis",
        "s4_text": "Processing is based on the performance of the sales contract (GDPR, art. 6.1.b). For marketing communications, the basis is explicit consent (art. 6.1.a).",
        "s5_title": "5. Data retention",
        "s5_text": "Order data is kept for the legally required period (5 years for tax purposes). Once that period ends, the data is securely deleted.",
        "s6_title": "6. Sharing with third parties",
        "s6_text": "We don't sell or share your data with third parties for commercial purposes. We only share it with the logistics provider needed to deliver your order and with the payment platform to process the transaction, both bound by confidentiality agreements.",
